=Bomber=
*  Health: 5
*  Price: %Minerals% 160
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 4
*  [[concepts/attack range|Hrz. Attack range]]: 0 (VerticalBeam)
*  Can attack independently of movement action
*  Does not require ammunition
*  1 attack per round
*  Explosion radius: 2
*  Damage: 7
This plane-turret type can attack objects in range.
*  Can safely fall down 1 height level
*  Stationary on ground (supported by water)
*  Speed: 5 (aerial)
Suborbital planes move above the regular terrain. They can scan the surface, and are invisible to ordinary radar.
